  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="62e15e84-02b4-59c0-b241-568be4d5eb48" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Accept finite numeric temperature from a registered source, retaining occurredAt and receivedAt separately.&#10;Three consecutive accepted samples above 28 C open at most one unresolved incident; duplicates/older sequences do not update state and gaps reset the run.&#10;After five minutes without an accepted sample mark data STALE; only assigned technicians/supervisors resolve with a nonblank note.&#10;This is supervisory comfort information; there is no physical actuation or safety guarantee.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
